			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action realistic vertical 9:16 video, 15 seconds total, soft natural daylight from a window, gentle depth of field; the stylized reference is reinterpreted as photorealistic live-action while preserving identity, hairstyle, ears, costume and setting. The shot begins exactly from <Picture 1>: a photorealistic young woman with long silver-white hair and fluffy white fox ears, a silver hairpin at the side of her hair, dangling silver earrings, an ornate silver necklace with a dark gem pendant, a white off-shoulder dress with fluffy white fur trim along the neckline and wide flowing sleeves, and a pink sash tied in a large bow at her waist, seated on a round blue-and-white carved stool in front of a bright window, green plant leaves at frame right, pink rose petals drifting slowly in the air. Static shot with a very slow push-in. From 0.00 to 0.8s she is nearly still, then blinks naturally, her smile widens playfully and she tilts her head slightly to her right. At 1.6s she raises her right hand in a small friendly wave at shoulder height, palm toward camera. At 2.4s her lips part and she begins speaking while looking directly into the lens. The woman (S1), a young female voice, sweet, bright and coquettish, medium pace, says: <d>[Chinese] 道友们记得，点赞、投币、收藏哦。</d> As she speaks, she extends only her index finger and taps it forward toward the camera three times, one crisp tap per listed item: first tap at 4.6s on \"点赞\", second tap at 6.0s on \"投币\", third tap at 7.4s on \"收藏\", each tap a small forward-down press with a light bounce back, eyebrows lifting with a mischievous expression, while her left hand rests on her lap. Her lips move in sync with the line and close naturally at 8.6s into a grin; petals keep drifting downward throughout. [Shot 2] At 00:09.000, the camera cuts to a medium close-up from the chest up with the same window light and drifting petals, background softly blurred. There is a clear hard cut to a new action state; the previous speaking action has completely ended before this shot begins: her lips are naturally closed in a warm smile, both hands empty, right hand lowered. She leans slightly toward the camera, gives one playful wink with her right eye at 10.2s, then at 11.2s raises her right hand beside her cheek and forms a small finger heart with thumb and index finger, holding it steady while her smile brightens and her fox ears sway faintly with the movement. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed. At 13.5s she relaxes the gesture, tilts her head to her left and ends with a soft sweet smile at the lens as the last petals drift past, holding the pose until 15.00 seconds.\n\noverall_soundscape: A quiet bright indoor room tone with faint airy ambience near the window. Soft fabric rustle as the woman waves, taps and shifts posture, plus a tiny soft tick of air with each finger tap and a faint petal-soft whoosh as she winks. No other voices or sounds beyond her single spoken line described in the shots.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A quiet off-screen background track at about 90 BPM with soft plucked strings, sparse glockenspiel notes, light brushed percussion and a gentle low pulse, dynamics kept low under the dialogue; three short staccato plucks align with the three finger taps, and the track resolves on one soft final pluck near 14.5 seconds.",
				1344,
				768,
				73
			],
